{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202656S4g53SWq1793656508.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名日籍女DJ前日在尖沙咀飲了懷疑遭人「落藥」的飲品後，感到不適。警方經調查後，拘捕一名涉案男子。</p><p></p><p>警方指，案發於本月1日凌晨4時許，該名有香港身份證、做唱片騎師的33歲日籍女子，在尖沙咀麼地道一間娛樂場所喝下疑含有不明藥物的飲品後不適，清醒送院治理。警方調查後，昨日在中區拘捕一名61歲本地男子，涉嫌「意圖損害等而施用毒藥」罪名。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T22:40:39.753148+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T21:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:18:20.136525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T22:38:14.316285+00:00","content_hash":"b0f40fd04e655d29176fc2342ef344f4207f682a89cd95254f1c6685364534d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T22:40:39.753148+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}